    "text": "By Jake Durant ,\n1 days ago MARQUETTE, Mich. - Northern Michigan's Jacy Weisbrod has been named the Great Lakes Intercollegiate Athletic Confernce (GLIAC) Offensive Player of the Week after scoring a career-high 33 points in NMU's 83-77 victory over Northwood on Dec. 17. Weisbrod buried four of her eight triples in the first five minutes to... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
